      "Transparency": 0,
      "Position": "81.34845, 102.42149, -133.19092",
      "Text": "백팩장착:의자앉고 폭죽을 허리에 설치"
    },
    {
      "ShowShadow": true,
      "Anchored": true,
      "CanCollide": true,
      "Rotation": "-180.00001,0,-180.00001",
      "Transparency": 1,
      "Position": "86.34848, 98.92149, -108.19077",
      "Text": "베리어가동"
    },
    {
      "ShowShadow": true,
      "Anchored": true,
      "CanCollide": true,
      "Rotation": "-29.18232,-58.01071,37.53689",
      "Transparency": 1,
      "Position": "23529436.00000, 16853500.00000, 9325525.00000",
      "Text": "물론물고기도잡아서먹기도했지"
    },
    {
      "ShowShadow": true,
      "Anchored": true,
      "CanCollide": true,
      "Rotation": "-29.18232,-58.01071,37.53689",
      "Transparency": 1,
      "Position": "23529436.00000, 16853502.00000, 9325524.00000",
      "Text": "우린이무인도를탈출했어"
    },
    {
      "ShowShadow": true,
      "Anchored": true,
      "CanCollide": true,
      "Rotation": "-29.19035,-58.01624,37.53007",
      "Transparency": 1,
      "Position": "23529436.00000, 16853500.00000, 9325525.00000",
      "Text": "우린결국땟목을만들었지"
    },
    {
      "ShowShadow": true,
      "Anchored": true,
      "CanCollide": true,
      "Rotation": "-29.17815,-58.01356,37.54404",
      "Transparency": 1,
      "Position": "23529434.00000, 16853502.00000, 9325523.00000",
      "Text": "그때조종기가고장이났었어..."
    },
    {
      "ShowShadow": true,
      "Anchored": true,
      "CanCollide": true,
      "Rotation": "-29.18232,-58.01071,37.53689",
      "Transparency": 1,
      "Position": "23529436.00000, 16853500.00000, 9325526.00000",
      "Text": "제발그땟목만은...."
    },
    {
      "ShowShadow": true,
      "Anchored": true,
      "CanCollide": true,
      "Rotation": "-29.18232,-58.01071,37.53689",
      "Transparency": 1,
      "Position": "23529434.00000, 16853502.00000, 9325522.00000",
      "Text": "여길어떻게온건지는모르겠지만"
    },
    {
      "ShowShadow": true,
      "Anchored": true,
      "CanCollide": true,
      "Rotation": "-29.17184,-58.01494,37.54577",
      "Transparency": 1,
      "Position": "23529434.00000, 16853502.00000, 9325522.00000",
      "Text": "이걸보고있다면이섬은이미잠겨있젰지"
    },
    {
      "ShowShadow": true,
      "Anchored": true,
      "CanCollide": true,
      "Rotation": "-29.18232,-58.01071,37.53689",
      "Transparency": 1,
      "Position": "23529434.00000, 16853502.00000, 9325524.00000",
      "Text": "이런일이없었을텐데..."
    },
    {
      "ShowShadow": true,
      "Anchored": true,
      "CanCollide": true,
      "Rotation": "-29.18232,-58.01071,37.53689",
      "Transparency": 1,
      "Position": "23529436.00000, 16853500.00000, 9325524.00000",
      "Text": "바닷물을끓여마시면서악착같이살아남았지"
    },
    {
      "ShowShadow": true,
      "Anchored": true,
      "CanCollide": true,
      "Rotation": "-29.18232,-58.01071,37.53689",
      "Transparency": 1,
      "Position": "23529434.00000, 16853502.00000, 9325523.00000",
      "Text": "그때정상적으로잘작동했었으면..."
    },
